OL,3,GNEWSA'People are skint' so why is      
OL,4,Awaterfront thriving?                   
OL,6,FThe bar is one of several changes to   
OL,7,Fthe food and drink offering along      
OL,8,FNeptune Marina, including a previously 
OL,9,Fvacant coffee shop and a restaurant    
OL,10,Fbeing brought back to life.            
